{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/926180/extras/4abe8ee39b3887689dfa3365dd0550ee.poster.avif?t=1757438129\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/926180/extras/4abe8ee39b3887689dfa3365dd0550ee.webm?t=1757438129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/926180/extras/4abe8ee39b3887689dfa3365dd0550ee.mp4?t=1757438129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From the developers of the BIT.TRIP series comes Bubsy: Paws on Fire!, the latest and greatest in bobcat-based gaming. <br><br>Oinker P. Hamm is determined to capture every animal in the universe for his \u201cAmazootorium.\u201d Bubsy, fearing mostly for himself, is just as determined to stop him. Two archrivals, stitched together by the cruel knitting needles of fate. No matter who emerges victorious, there is one thing we know for certain: There\u2019s going to be a whole lot of yarn along the way.<br><br>So, so much yarn.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four playable characters, each with their own unique mechanics! Fly and shoot your way through the air as The Woolie, take it underground with Arnold\u2019s bonus levels, or run your way to victory with Bubsy and Virgil Reality!<br></li><li>An all-new story featuring the unlikely alliance between Bubsy and his archrivals, The Woolies!<br></li><li>Over 100 levels set across three different worlds!<br></li><li>Three boss battles!<br></li><li>A unique combo system and set of leaderboards for every character!<br></li><li>A shop with costumes and cosmetics, all of which players can unlock just by playing the game. There are no in-game purchases!<br></li><li>Unique character dialog for every level!<br></li><li>A variety of collectible types, ensuring maximum replayability!\u2028<br></li><li>The return of Oinker, Terri, Terry, and many other characters from previous Bubsy incarnations! We even have Virgil Reality from the Bubsy cartoon pilot\u2014we dug deep!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/926180/extras/362fee867b35e95bae40721b71026f48.poster.avif?t=1757438129\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/926180/extras/362fee867b35e95bae40721b71026f48.webm?t=1757438129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/926180/extras/362fee867b35e95bae40721b71026f48.mp4?t=1757438129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"856c945159e05feb99009e56c8272e4255de34c9.jpg","localized_name":"Are We There Yet?","name":"Are We There Yet?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/926180/856c945159e05feb99009e56c8272e4255de34c9.jpg"},{"icon":"fc07da21982e1db96325f3a9ff1a8a26d660db80.jpg","localized_name":"Hey, Big Spender!","name":"Hey, Big Spender!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/926180/fc07da21982e1db96325f3a9ff1a8a26d660db80.jpg"},{"icon":"351fe8c8c8da422515de714e965ffcbf93add945.jpg","localized_name":"Antsy, Are We?","name":"Antsy, Are We?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/926180/351fe8c8c8da422515de714e965ffcbf93add945.jpg"},{"icon":"b8bc06a1407aa973852ecccd4d9b14d6eac4cef7.jpg","localized_name":"Knit Happens","name":"Knit Happens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/926180/b8bc06a1407aa973852ecccd4d9b14d6eac4cef7.jpg"},{"icon":"b1ef63629411ea685b151ec19dbd718ea7591f31.jpg","localized_name":"Air Bub","name":"Air Bub","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcomm